meanings
  statistics_operation
    defined-by statistics
  statistics_mean
    defined-by statistics_operation
    role statistics_operation
    formula "mean = (sum of the values) / (how many values)"
    source "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arithmetic_mean"
    lexeme en mean average "arithmetic mean"
    lexeme ru среднее "среднее значение" "среднее арифметическое"
    lexeme hi माध्य
    lexeme zh 平均数 平均值 均值
    lexeme es media promedio "media aritmética"
  statistics_median
    defined-by statistics_operation
    role statistics_operation
    formula "median = the middle value once the values are sorted (the average of the two middle values when the count is even)"
    source "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Median"
    lexeme en median
    lexeme ru медиана медиану медианы
    lexeme hi माध्यिका
    lexeme zh 中位数 中位數
    lexeme es mediana
  statistics_mode
    defined-by statistics_operation
    role statistics_operation
    formula "mode = the value that appears most often"
    source "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mode_(statistics)"
    lexeme en mode "most common value" "most frequent value"
    lexeme ru мода моду моды
    lexeme hi बहुलक
    lexeme zh 众数 眾數
    lexeme es moda
  statistics_variance
    defined-by statistics_operation
    role statistics_operation
    formula "variance = the average of the squared differences from the mean (population form)"
    source "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Variance"
    lexeme en variance
    lexeme ru дисперсия дисперсию дисперсии
    lexeme hi प्रसरण
    lexeme zh 方差
    lexeme es varianza
  statistics_standard_deviation
    defined-by statistics_operation
    role statistics_operation
    formula "standard deviation = the square root of the variance (population form)"
    source "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Standard_deviation"
    lexeme en "standard deviation" stddev
    lexeme ru "стандартное отклонение" "среднеквадратичное отклонение"
    lexeme hi "मानक विचलन"
    lexeme zh 标准差 標準差
    lexeme es "desviación estándar" "desviación típica"
  statistics_percentile
    defined-by statistics_operation
    role statistics_operation
    formula "percentile p = x(k) + f × (x(k + 1) - x(k)), where the rank 1 + (n - 1) × p / 100 = k + f is read over the values sorted ascending (linear interpolation between closest ranks, the C = 1 variant; Hyndman and Fan definition 7)"
    source "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Percentile#The_linear_interpolation_between_closest_ranks_method"
    lexeme en percentile percentiles
    lexeme ru перцентиль перцентиля перцентили процентиль процентиля
    lexeme hi प्रतिशतक शततमक
    lexeme zh 百分位数 百分位
    lexeme es percentil percentiles
  statistics_range
    defined-by statistics_operation
    role statistics_operation
    formula "range = the largest value minus the smallest value"
    source "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Range_(statistics)"
    lexeme en range
    lexeme ru размах разброс
    lexeme hi परिसर
    lexeme zh 极差 全距 范围
    lexeme es rango recorrido
