  word_problem_change
    defined-by statistics_operation
    role word_problem_marker
    lexeme en change
    lexeme ru сдача сдачи сдачу
    lexeme hi "शेष राशि"
    lexeme zh 找零 找回
    lexeme es cambio
    role localized_response_template
    precondition "a priced-item change word problem is answered"
    effect "the payment minus the item cost is stated with its multiplication and subtraction"
    unit "not applicable"
    example "3 boxes cost 4 each and the payment is 20. The change is 20 - (3 x 4) = 8."
    grounding "data/seed/multilingual-responses-quantities.lino"
  word_problem_total
    defined-by statistics_operation
    role word_problem_marker
    lexeme en total "in total" altogether
    lexeme ru всего итого
    lexeme hi कुल
    lexeme zh 总共 一共 合计
    lexeme es total "en total"
    role localized_response_template
    precondition "a total-amount word problem over priced items is answered"
    effect "the total is stated with the multiplication and sum that produced it"
    unit "not applicable"
    example "4 tickets at 12 each cost 48 in total. 4 x 12 = 48."
    grounding "data/seed/multilingual-responses-quantities.lino"
  number_property_prime
    grounded-in Q49008
    defined-by statistics_operation
    role number_property
    formula "n is prime when n > 1 and no integer d with 2 <= d <= floor(sqrt(n)) divides n"
    source "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prime_number"
    lexeme en prime "prime number"
    lexeme ru простое простым "простое число"
    lexeme hi अभाज्य "अभाज्य संख्या"
    lexeme zh 质数 素数
    lexeme es primo "número primo"
